<title>UK: Bayer Hypo sets two bln Lux franc bond due 2004.</title>
<headline>Bayer Hypo sets two bln Lux franc bond due 2004.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following subordinated bond was announced by joint lead managers Banque Generale du Luxembourg and Kredietbank Luxembourg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BAYERISCHE HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    2.0 BLN FLUX  COUPON     5.625     MATURITY    14.MAY.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.45    PAY DATE   L14.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     LISTING    LUX	 L-LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA3/=     DENOMS (K) 50-250    SALE LIMITS US/UK/GE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    LUX	 HOME CTRY  GERMANY   PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
